  "source": "The merge of the two lines of 22 Nov 2026: this branch (Main 4441e92 with the owner's Test 83 reader and GUI lines, recorded as: Main 776c9259 (origin/main on 16 Nov 2026), the production text before the Toy test sources were merged; include/kui/retail_loader_layout.h, src/loader/retail_async.c, retail_display.c, retail_resident.S, retail_resident.c, retail_stage.c and sci_sd_bus.c as Main 4441e92 has them (20 Nov 2026), with the Windows CE data probe's text of a257f13 and c25e9f5; src/core/wce_probe_fat.c as Main 4441e92 has it) and claude/great-darwin-yjmgfi at b616e2db (Main 776c9259 (origin/main on 16 Nov 2026), the production text before the Toy test sources were merged; then the reviewed WinCE data probe hunks (KUI_WCE_PROBE, a257f13e and c25e9f5e); then the reviewed CE VRAM stream admission (KUI_RETAIL_CE_VRAM_DMA); then the reviewed generic WinCE reader switches (KUI_CE_SLOW_WINDOW, KUI_CE_SLOW_ADAPT, KUI_CE_POOL_KIB, KUI_CE_READAHEAD)). Four sources were changed in production by both lines (include/kui/retail_loader_layout.h, src/loader/retail_resident.S, retail_resident.c, retail_stage.c); their production text is the clean three-way union of both lines' changes. Then the Windows CE line to 83becb53 (22 Nov 2026): src/loader/retail_stage.c gains its KUI_ARMADA_CE_BOOT2_SCRATCH block, the clean union again. Then the Windows CE line to b7c92e0c (22 Nov 2026), which records the same retail_stage.c changes (9e89e778's kernel records and KUI_ARMADA_CE_BOOT2_SCRATCH) for that line alone; no shared source changes, so the union's fingerprints stand.",
